    "note": "NEEDS NATIVE + SAFE-MESSAGING REVIEW (A9) before alpha: te and te-Latn by a native speaker, every entry against the WHO / AFSP / Samaritans safe-messaging checklist. Seed list written by the dev team.",
    "open": [
      "te-Latn 'chachipotha' (I'll die) is often hyperbole ('aakali tho chachipotha'); kept as crisis until reviewed.",
      "en 'dont want to live' also matches 'I don't want to live here'; kept as crisis (a gentle sheet beats a miss).",
      "te 'చంపుకోవాలని' / te-Latn 'champukovalani': confirm they read as self-directed."
    ]
